  "notable_quotes": [
    "At 77 K and 1 atm, MAF-7 stores slightly more H2 than MAF-4 (1.38% vs 1.31%), with a steeper low-pressure isotherm indicating stronger binding.",
    "Replacing a C-H moiety in MAF-4 with an isoelectronic N can create a Lewis basic guest-binding site on the pore surface.",
    "Proper design lets the triazolate ligand leave one N atom unbound in the framework, providing a noncoordinated pore-surface site."
